//! What the engine's own sources read and fire, generated by build.rs from
//! every tree the engine code lives in (ENGINE_READS / ENGINE_FIRES).
//!
//! The gap telemetry that uses them is in rustudio-core, below the engine
//! code, so it cannot generate them itself: it takes them through
//! `telemetry::install_engine_tables` at start-up (`studio_hooks::install`).
//! Nothing reads them before that point.

include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/engine_reads.rs"));
